# Redeploy after push to develop-koncar

When the user asks how to deploy or update the live site after a git push, give these cPanel Terminal commands exactly (then Restart the Node.js app in cPanel):

```bash
source ~/nodevenv/koncar-elektro-live/koncar-elektro-store/22/bin/activate
cd ~/koncar-elektro-live/koncar-elektro-store
git pull origin develop-koncar
npm ci
npm run build
```

Live Next.js app is `koncarelektro.rs`. WordPress stays on `cms.koncarelektro.rs` and does not need this deploy for CMS-only edits.
